                <div class="prose max-w-none">

                    <p>This Privacy Policy governs the information form ("Contact Form") provided by MyNasional eKYC Sdn Bhd (Registration No. 201101030830 (958965-W)) from L9-2, Wisma Conlay, 1, Jalan USJ 10/1, Subang Jaya, 47620 Selangor, Malaysia (referred to as "We"). The information form includes, but is not limited to, forms provided by websites, portals, blogs or any other platforms designed by us ("Portal").</p>

                    <p>By browsing, using, accessing or registering with our Portal and/or subscribing to or using our products and/or services, you agree to comply with this Privacy Policy and you agree to us collecting, using, storing and disclosing your personal data in accordance with this Privacy Policy. We will process personal information provided by you or any third party and/or further information and data that may be required by us from time to time.</p>

                    <h2>A. Collection of Information</h2>

                    <p>(1) We collect personal information when you:</p>
                    <ol type="a">
