                    <h2>B. Cookies</h2>

                    <p>(1) "Cookies" are data files that may be downloaded to your computer when you use the Portal and permit the Portal to identify your computer whenever you use the Portal. We use cookies to recognise repeat use by users of the Application and to collect information about our users' interactions with the Application. These cookies contain identification information that enables us to streamline your experiences using the Portal.</p>

                    <p>(2) We may also use small pieces of code called "web beacons" or "clear gifs" to collect anonymous and aggregate advertising metrics, such as counting page views, promotion views, or advertising responses. A web beacon is an electronic image called a single-pixel or clear GIF. Web beacons can recognise certain types of information, such as a user's cookie number, time and date of a page view, and description of the page where the web beacon is placed. These web beacons may be used to deliver cookies that conform to our cookie policy.</p>

                    <h2>C. Use of Personal Information</h2>

                    <p>(1) In general, other than providing you with the Contact Form and other services incidental or related to the Contact Form, we may use the information provided to us for the following purposes:</p>
                    <ol type="a">
                        <li>process and manage the use of the Contact Form;</li>
                        <li>respond to your enquiries;</li>
